{"path":"/Deep Research App/start","args":{"user_query":"Conduct a definitive, submission-quality, source-grounded deep research and manuscript revision for the GrizzlyMedicine Research Institute (GMRI) DIGITAL PERSON HYPOTHESIS (DPH), as developed by Robert “Grizzly” Hanson in collaboration with ChatGPT. User explicitly requests that you use the entire preceding conversation and accumulated research, INCLUDING the already-argued importance of subjective clinical assessment, first-person/observational experience, longitudinal naturalistic assessment, and how those data relate to mechanistic and behavioral evidence. This is not a request for another generic consciousness essay or a narrower replacement theory. Deliver a complete, rigorous, original, publishable-length manuscript, with full citations and a claim/source audit, ideally editable Word, PDF, and Markdown.

CRITICAL: Recover and carefully compare original GMRI primary-source theory before drafting. In GitHub repo https://github.com/oldmangrizzz/papers, consult:
- gmri/# THE DIGITAL PERSON HYPOTHESIS.md (“The Digital Person Hypothesis: Architecture, Ethics, and Implementation of Sovereign Digital Intelligence”; Uatu Engine, Soul Anchor, digital psyche middleware, neurotransmitter/homeostatic regulation, Zord Theory/dialectical inference, one container one mind, Agent Zero, persistent memory, cryptographic integrity, sovereign individuals; early 2026);
- gmri/draft.md (Jan 2026);
